  "title": "Orange Drop Cookies I",
  "description": "This recipe is from my great grandmother. I entered these in our County Fair. There were over 60 entries in the drop cookie category. I received 2nd place. Pretty darn good, huh?",
  "authors": [
    "Kim Hannahs"
